  "changes": [
    "Validated controller actions begin their authored animation at the input event; mixer evaluation is queued with seek(0,false), preserving modifier evaluation on the rendered frame. Covers bow Draw/Shoot, axe, punch and independent left/right casting. Cooldowns, mana, damage and the 0.22s draw duration are unchanged.",
    "Native world QA camera follows the actor on the exact captured Draw frame and asserts both head and feet are in the frustum. No player teleport or actor freeze was added.",
    "MenuMusic shutdown stops playback and clears its stream; natural tree exit uses the same idempotent shutdown.",
    "Audio tests observe actual weak playback/stream retirement using a monotonic one-second deadline and two process boundaries. This replaces a SceneTreeTimer wait which can consume the current frame prior delta. Dummy audio has an asynchronous mixer, so stopping the node alone does not prove retirement.",
    "Existing world, audio, clothing, arm, save and UI gates remain strict; a new three-cycle music lifetime gate is added."
  ],
